{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9ac868099ead8daa","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9008-E004\n3\ttitle: Enterprise admin configuration experience\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9008\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9008-E001\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9008-E001\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: If the direction conflict cannot be resolved, re-scope this epic\n15\t    to whichever direction the strategy owner confirms, or split into separate epics\n16\t    per direction if both are pursued independently.\n17\tai_signals:\n18\t  change_specificity: -1\n19\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n20\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n21\t  existing_foundation: 1\n22\t  open_questions: -1\n23\t  external_dependency: 0\n24\t  human_process_gates: 0\n25\t  repo_access: 1\n26\t  architecture_claims: 0\n27\timplementation_type: null\n28\tinvestigation_signals: null\n29\tai_implementability: Medium\n30\tai_implementability_score: 1\n31\tjira_key: null\n32\tbranch: null\n33\t---\n34\t# Enterprise admin configuration experience\n35\t\n36\t## Description\n37\t\n38\tThis epic delivers the administrative configuration experience chosen by the\n39\tpreceding investigation into the conflicting enterprise feedback: either the\n40\tsimplified configuration surface, the fine-grained per-project controls, or a\n41\treconciliation of both. The Dashboard is the console surface for per-component\n42\tfeature flags and defaults (via the OdhDashboardConfig CR) and is where\n43\tadministrators interact with configuration today.\n44\t\n45\t## Scope\n46\t\n47\t- Implement the configuration-experience direction recorded in the\n48\t  investigation's decision (simplification, granularity, or tiered\n49\t  combination), across the configuration surfaces the decision enumerates.\n50\t- Cover the relevant console surfaces for administering configuration\n51\t  defaults and per-project overrides.\n52\t- Include incidental documentation touch-ups (updated captions, labels, or\n53\t  references in existing admin docs) that fall out of the same change — no new\n54\t  doc topics are authored here.\n55\t- Validate the experience against representative administrator personas from\n56\t  the consolidated enterprise feedback.\n57\t\n58\tExact scope is finalized from the investigation's decision record; do not\n59\tpre-commit to specific settings or UI structures beyond what it specifies.\n60\t\n61\t## Acceptance Criteria\n62\t\n63\t- The configuration experience matches the direction and surfaces enumerated in\n64\t  the investigation's confirmed decision.\n65\t- An administrator from the \"too many knobs\" account persona can complete\n66\t  representative configuration tasks with fewer exposed options (or the\n67\t  equivalent chosen direction), verified by the success measure the decision\n68\t  defines.\n69\t- An administrator from the fine-grained-controls persona retains the control\n70\t  the decision requires (or the reconciliation satisfies both), verified\n71\t  likewise.\n72\t- The change does not remove capability required by existing users that the\n73\t  decision did not authorize removing.\n74\t- Incidental doc touch-ups from the same change are included.\n75\t- Because this work may replace existing admin configuration behavior: a\n76\t  rollback path or feature flag allows reverting to the current experience.\n77\t\n78\t## HLR Traceability\n79\t\n80\t- HLR-1 — Administration should be simpler (conflicting directions: fewer\n81\t  exposed options vs. more fine-grained per-project controls).\n82\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-854b3bc7d232f952","agent_id":"a465806246728c774","session_id":"cc08ccf1-892e-454d-8ed1-68ebd3e76220","uuid":"a3ee5fd2-6fcc-4318-9202-cf2c906b321b","timestamp":"2026-10-08T16:54:23.429Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9ac868099ead8daa